  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fix missing request timeouts and cancellation support in two HTTP code paths: the .NET Framework 4.7.2 HttpWebRequest-based fallback used by KlapTransport, and the periodic keepalive requests sent by TpapTransport. Both previously relied on the runtime default timeout (about 100 seconds) instead of the configured DeviceConfiguration.Timeout and were not reliably cancellable once a request was in flight. Both now honor the configured timeout and an external CancellationToken, with careful handling to avoid misclassifying a genuine network failure as a cancellation when the two race.",
